cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "deep-persona-dns: reference implementation of the Dialogue Naturalness Score"
abstract: >-
  A reference-free metric for how far an agent's dialogue departs from human
  conversational behaviour. Computes a behavioural profile over an agent's
  turns, compares it with the same profile over a corpus of human dialogue by
  Mahalanobis distance, and reports both a naturalness score and a chi-squared
  test of whether the dialogue is distinguishable from the human baseline.
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/rtmdrr/Dialogue-Naturalness-Score-DNS-"
